WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:27.240
You type job. The record says jobs.

00:00:27.240 --> 00:01:00.983
First choose the boundaries

00:01:00.983 --> 00:01:30.887
Then decide which terms survive

00:01:30.887 --> 00:02:04.241
A matching key or a dictionary form?

00:02:04.241 --> 00:02:35.855
Convergence helps—and can go wrong

00:02:35.855 --> 00:03:08.533
Two analysers must meet at lookup

00:03:08.533 --> 00:03:47.567
Truncation is another operation
